Data

  - tests/client/data/libero_frames.npz: four frames rendered in the LIBERO simulation benchmark
    (https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO).
  - src/playground_serve/worker/selftest_pi05_libero.json: the first of those frames as JPEG (quality 90), with the
    actions that stock openpi's pi05_libero returned for it.
  - src/playground_serve/families/abc_vla/selftest_abc_vla_yam.json and
    src/playground_serve/families/xiaomi_r1/selftest_xiaomi_r1_robocasa365.json: frames of assets/bottles_real.mp4 in
    the ABC repository by Amazon FAR (https://github.com/amazon-far/abc, Apache License 2.0), resized and encoded as
    JPEG, with the actions the models returned for them.
  - src/playground_serve/families/gr00t_n17/selftest_gr00t_n17_libero.json: frame 80 of episode 0 of
    demo_data/libero_demo in NVIDIA's Isaac-GR00T repository (https://github.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T, Apache License
    2.0), as JPEG, with its recorded state and task and the actions GR00T N1.7 returned for it.
  - src/playground_serve/families/molmoact2/selftest_molmoact2_*.json: the sample input images of the model cards of
    allenai/MolmoAct2-LIBERO, -DROID, -SO100_101 and -BimanualYAM on Hugging Face (Ai2, Apache License 2.0; frames
    from the LIBERO, DROID, Beegbrain/pick_lemon_and_drop_in_bowl and ai2-cortex datasets the cards name), shrunk to
    128 or 160 pixels wide and encoded as JPEG, with the cards' states and tasks and the actions MolmoAct2 returned.
  - tests/families/data/droid_obs.json, src/playground_serve/families/cosmos3_policy/selftest_cosmos3_edge_droid.json
    and src/playground_serve/families/flux3_action/verify_obs.json: frames 60 and 120 of episode 1 of the
    lerobot/droid_1.0.1 dataset on Hugging Face (DROID; Apache License 2.0 per its card), the three cameras as recorded
    (180 x 320) encoded as JPEG (quality 90), with their joint and gripper positions and task, and the actions Cosmos 3
    Edge returned for the first.
  - src/playground_serve/families/flex_pi/selftest_flex_pi_libero.json: frame 30 of libero_spatial episode 0 of the
    flex-pi/libero_mujoco3.3.2_depth dataset on Hugging Face (CC BY 4.0), RGB as JPEG (quality 90) and depth as 16-bit
    PNG, shrunk, with its state and task and the actions Flex-pi returned.


